       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. T6V2P5B.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-QUEUE-COUNT           PIC 9(4) VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-CUSTOMER-ID           PIC X(12).
       01  WS-REGISTRY-STATUS       PIC X(8) VALUE 'PENDING'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-QUEUE-COUNT
           PERFORM 2000-PROCESS-QUEUE WS-QUEUE-COUNT TIMES
           STOP RUN.
       2000-PROCESS-QUEUE.
           ACCEPT WS-CUSTOMER-ID
           PERFORM 3000-UPLOAD-RECORD
           DISPLAY WS-CUSTOMER-ID WS-REGISTRY-STATUS.
       3000-UPLOAD-RECORD.
           MOVE 'UPLOADED' TO WS-REGISTRY-STATUS.
